{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivorgmn\/gmnvalidator\/issue"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/missingRequiredParameter(_:_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/missingTagBody(_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/unboundPositionalParameter(_:index:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/unexpectedTagBody(_:)","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/unreadableParameterValue(_:)"],"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/message"],"title":"Instance Properties","generated":true},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue\/Equatable-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Issue"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/UsingIvorGMN"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"What is judged here","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"What-is-judged-here"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything a repair cannot reach. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNParser"},{"type":"text","text":" rejects what could never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be repaired and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer"},{"type":"text","text":" repairs what it can, but neither"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"judges: normalization is total, so a defect it could not repair arrives"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"here intact."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two of the five are about a tag’s "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"body"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", and whether a tag scopes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"something is a fact about the score around it, which no repair could"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"guess at. The other three are about its "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"parameters"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":", and each is a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"value that was written and then thrown away unread."}]},{"text":"Why the parameter issues are judged after normalization","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Why-the-parameter-issues-are-judged-after-normalization"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A defect is only definite once every repair has been tried. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\volta"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requires "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"mark"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\volta<m=\"1.\">"},{"type":"text","text":" supplies it under a name since"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"renamed — so the tag is missing a required parameter as written and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"complete after "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer\/normalize(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" renames it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The same holds for a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"$variable"},{"type":"text","text":" that expands into a closed vocabulary,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and for a span end whose written parameters are dropped before they can"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overrun its template. This is why "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/validate(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" throws"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Error\/notNormalized"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than judging an unnormalized score."}]},{"text":"Every issue is fatal","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Every-issue-is-fatal"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There is no grading, and no issue is advisory. Any of the five leaves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/validate(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" returning the score unvalidated, because"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a set this small holds nothing worth tolerating: a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\slur"},{"type":"text","text":" scoping"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"nothing, a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\title"},{"type":"text","text":" scoping something, and a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\clef"},{"type":"text","text":" with no type are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all defects the writer meant otherwise."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Guido renderer warns on every one of the five and draws the score"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"anyway. That is a divergence, and a deliberate one — a renderer answers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“can something be drawn?”, and this is a library answering “is this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"score well formed?”. In each case a value that was written is thrown"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"away without being read, and the rendered score says nothing about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loss. What each field "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"means"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" is Guido’s to say; what to do about a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"violation is not."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"An issue found when validating a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNScore"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IvorGMN"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorGMN12GMNValidatorV5IssueO","roleHeading":"Enumeration","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Issue","kind":"identifier"}],"extendedModule":"IvorGMN","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Issue","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"GMNValidator.Issue","symbolKind":"enum"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNValidator\/Issue"},"references":{"doc://IvorGMN/documentation/IvorGMN/GMNTag/RangeSetting-swift.enum/no":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"no","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The tag must not have a body. This is the default for any tag","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"that does not say otherwise."}],"title":"GMNTag.RangeSetting.no","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/RangeS